This package implements the platform interface of the FlutterFire
firebase_storage plugin (firebase_storage_platform_interface, Copyright 2020
the Chromium project authors, BSD 3-Clause license) and the platform interface
of firebase_core (firebase_core_platform_interface, BSD 3-Clause license). It
depends on those packages; it does not copy their code. The work is done by
firebase_storage_dart, an unofficial pure-Dart client of the Cloud Storage for
Firebase REST API.

